<title>USA: Florida HFA Remarketing yields 4.10 pct 2004.</title>
<headline>Florida HFA Remarketing yields 4.10 pct 2004.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-03-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>John Nuveen &amp; Co, Inc said it tentatively priced $17.155 million remarketing of Florida Housing Finance Agency multi-family housing revenue refunding bonds, 1989 series D with an initial rate and yield of 4.10 percent in 2004.</p>
